# LightGBM Importances

```elixir
Mix.install([
  {:explorer, "~> 0.11", override: true},
  {:kino, "~> 0.18"},
  {:kino_vega_lite, "~> 0.1"},
  {:kino_data_input, path: "/data/mix_lib/kino_data_input"},
  {:kino_my_vegalite, path: "/data/mix_lib/kino_my_vegalite"},
  {:titanic, path: "/data/mix_lib/kaggle/titanic"},
  {:lgbm_ex, "0.0.2", github: "/tato-gh/lgbm_ex"}
])

Application.put_env(:lgbm_ex, :workdir, Path.join(System.tmp_dir!(), "lgbm_ex"))
alias Explorer.DataFrame, as: DF
```

## データ準備

```elixir
{frame, refs} = Kino.DataInput.frame_data_inputs()
frame
```

```elixir
{df_train_raw, df_test_raw} = Kino.DataInput.to_dataframe(refs)
:loaded
```

```elixir
{df_train, df_test, feature_names} = Kaggle.Titanic.preprocess(df_train_raw, df_test_raw)
feature_names
```

## モデル生成と学習曲線

```elixir
df_train |> DF.describe() |> DF.print()
```

```elixir
model = LgbmEx.fit("titanic", df_train, "Survived",
  objective: "binary",
  metric: "binary_logloss",
  # 200でほぼ収束するため指定
  num_iterations: 200
)
:learned
```

```elixir
model.learning_steps
|> Enum.map(& %{"value" => elem(&1, 0), "x" => elem(&1, 1)})
|> Kino.MyVegaLite.to_line(width: 400, height: 200)
```
